[00:00.300]I'm friends with the monster (我是妖魔的朋友)
[00:01.820]That's under my bed (来自床底)
[00:04.300]Get along with the voices inside of my head (和脑海中的声响淡定相处)
[00:08.428]You're trying to save me (你想拯救我么)
[00:10.530]Stop holding your breath (别屏息期待奇迹)
[00:12.979]And you think I'm crazy (你觉得我疯了)
[00:15.200]Yeah, you think I'm crazy (crazy) (呵呵  你觉得我疯了)
[00:18.299]I wanted the fame, but not the cover of Newsweek (我渴望声名  但不想要新闻周刊的头条关注)
[00:20.189]Oh well, guess beggars can't be choosey (好吧  我想作为乞丐没法太挑拣)
[00:22.130]Wanted to receive attention for my music (我希望我的音乐得到关注)
[00:24.419]Wanted to be left alone in public. Excuse me (众目睽睽下又希望不要被烦搅  真是抱歉)
[00:26.560]For wanting my cake and eat it too, and wanting it both ways (鱼和熊掌  我偏要兼得)
[00:29.290]Fame made me a balloon 'cause my ego inflated (声名让我如气球急剧膨胀)
[00:31.299]When I blew; see, but it was confusing (看吧  最终破裂开来 这让人迷惑)
[00:32.890]'Cause all I wanted to do is be the Bruce Lee of loose leaf (因为我想要的全部 就是成为歌词纸上的李小龙)
[00:35.920]Abused ink, used it as a tool when I blew steam (wooh!) (落墨无意  我却用它点起滚滚的蒸汽炉)
[00:38.610]Hit the lottery, oh wee (一把中头彩  哦耶)
[00:40.500]But with what I gave up to get it was bittersweet (想想我舍弃了什么  苦乐参半)
[00:42.190]It was like winning a used mink (好像一路牺牲赢得一件二手的貂皮衣)
[00:43.690]Ironic 'cause I think I'm getting so huge I need a shrink (真是讽刺  我如此自我膨胀  需要心理医生把我缩回去)
[00:46.600]I'm beginning to lose sleep: one sheep, two sheep (我开始失眠 一只羊  两只羊)
[00:48.870]Going cuckoo and cooky as Kool Keith (变得像 Kool Keith 一样古灵精怪)
[00:50.420]But I'm actually weirder than you think (但我比你想象得更加诡怪)
[00:52.110]'Cause I'm (因为我)
