[01:18.670]Well, that's nothing (何止是疯狂  这不值一提)
[01:27.730]Now, I ain't much of a poet but I know somebody once told me (我不是诗人  但有人告诉过我)
[01:30.320]To seize the moment and don't squander it (要攫住机会  不要浪费)
[01:31.970]'Cause you never know when it all could be over tomorrow (因为你永远不知道可能明天一切都烟消云散)
[01:34.059]So I keep conjuring, sometimes I wonder where these thoughts spawn from (所以我努力创造 有时我都不知道这些想法从何而来)
[01:37.289](Yeah, pondering'll do you wonders. (是啊  深思可以创造奇迹)
[01:39.000]No wonder you're losing your mind the way it wanders.)Yoda-loda-le-hee-hoo (难怪你失去理智  任由思绪徘徊 阿拉拉蒂啦)
[01:42.670]I think it went wandering off down yonder and stumbled on 'ta Jeff VanVonderen (我想思绪的来源不知所以 最后不觉想起了Jeff VanVonderen)
[01:46.460]'Cause I need an interventionist to intervene between me and this monster (因为我需要有人在我和这头恶魔之间筑起高墙)
[01:49.990]And save me from myself and all this conflict (拯救我于痛苦之间  来阻止这场厮杀)
